  "headline": "The official-16K design is well powered for the first adjacent increment and underpowered for the second: at the registered one-sided level 0.025 with 80% power the minimum detectable increment is 5.25 points (using the second contrast's SE), so the observed 3.75-point 1.5B->3B increment was detected at 0.52 power and is significant but marginal (p_Holm = 0.0255)."
